-- Final word list for the starter packs that change — one spelling per word:
-- * Words normally written in kana (Jisho: 'usually written using kana alone' — USUALLY_KANA in
--   src/lib/duplicates.ts): the kana card replaces the kanji card (有る → ある, 沢山 → たくさん)
--   in its slot, at the easier of the two levels; other copies of that word go.
-- * Every other pair where both are N5 and in different packs: only the kanji card / the base
--   word stays (みず goes, 水 stays; 海に goes, 海 stays). N4 pairs are left as they are.
-- Unique N5 words across the packs after this: 896. Sets each pack's full list, so it gives
-- the same result if run twice. Replaces the earlier version of this file.

