akana","reading":"かたかな","japanese":"片仮名","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"''Coffee'' is written in Katakana.","jp":"「コーヒー」は片仮名で書きます。"}},{"english":"january","reading":"いちがつ","japanese":"一月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"January is very cold.","jp":"一月はとても寒いです。"}},{"english":"february","reading":"にがつ","japanese":"二月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"Setsubun occurs in February.","jp":"二月には節分があります。"}},{"english":"march","reading":"さんがつ","japanese":"三月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"March is the graduation season.","jp":"三月は卒業の季節です。"}},{"english":"april","reading":"しがつ","japanese":"四月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"There is an entrance ceremony in April.","jp":"四月は入学式があります。"}},{"english":"may","reading":"ごがつ","japanese":"五月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"It was nice weather, like a clear May day.","jp":"五月晴れの良い天気でした。"}},{"english":"june","reading":"ろくがつ","japanese":"六月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"It rains a lot in June.","jp":"六月は雨が多いです。"}},{"english":"july","reading":"しちがつ","japanese":"七月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"I want to go to the sea in July.","jp":"七月には海に行きたいです。"}},{"english":"august","reading":"はちがつ","japanese":"八月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"August is summer vacation.","jp":"八月は夏休みです。"}},{"english":"september","reading":"くがつ","japanese":"九月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"It started to get cooler in September.","jp":"九月は涼しくなってきました。"}},{"english":"october","reading":"じゅうがつ","japanese":"十月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"Autumn leaves are beautiful in October.","jp":"十月は紅葉が美しいです。"}},{"english":"november","reading":"じゅういちがつ","japanese":"十一月","jlpt_level":"N5","partOfSpeech":"noun","e