る。"}},{"english":"hair / fur","reading":"け","japanese":"毛","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"Cat hair got on my clothes.","jp":"猫の毛が服についた。"}},{"english":"injury","reading":"けが","japanese":"怪我","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"I fell and got injured.","jp":"転んで怪我をした。"}},{"english":"but / however","reading":"けれど","japanese":"けれど","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"conjunction","exampleSentence":{"en":"It was raining, but I didn''t have an umbrella.","jp":"雨が降っていた、けれど傘を持っていなかった。"}},{"english":"entrance","reading":"げんかん","japanese":"玄関","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"I put my shoes in the entrance.","jp":"靴を玄関に置きました。"}},{"english":"high school student","reading":"こうこうせい","japanese":"高校生","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"High school students are busy.","jp":"高校生は忙しい。"}},{"english":"breakdown","reading":"こしょう","japanese":"故障","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"I was late due to a car breakdown.","jp":"車の故障で遅刻しました。"}},{"english":"feast","reading":"ごちそう","japanese":"ご馳走","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"It was a delicious feast.","jp":"美味しいご馳走でした。"}},{"english":"this way","reading":"こっち","japanese":"こっち","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"pronoun","exampleSentence":{"en":"Please come this way.","jp":"こっちに来てください。"}},{"english":"recently","reading":"このあいだ","japanese":"この間","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"adverb","exampleSentence":{"en":"I found an interesting book at the library the other day.","jp":"この間、図書館で面白い本を見つけました。"}},{"english":"lately","reading":"このごろ","japanese":"この頃","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"adverb","exampleSentence":{"en":"I''ve been busy lately.","jp":"この頃、忙しいです。"}},{"english":"small","reading":"こまかい","japanese":"細かい","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"adjective","exampleSentence":{"en":"It''s difficult to read small characters.","jp":"細かい文字を読むのは難しい。"}},{"english":"crowded","reading":"こむ","japanese":"混む","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"The train is very crowded.","jp":"電車がとても混んでいる。"}},{"english":"from now on","reading":"これから","japanese":"これから","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"adverb","exampleSentence":{"en":"I will start studying from now on.","jp":"これから勉強を始めます。"}},{"english":"scary","reading":"こわい","japanese":"怖い","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"adjective","exampleSentence":{"en":"Dark places are scary.","jp":"暗い場所は怖い。"}},{"english":"next time","reading":"こんど","japanese":"今度","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"Let''s go eat together next time.","jp":"今度、一緒に食事に行きましょう。"}},{"english":"recently","reading":"さいきん","japanese":"最近","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"Many new movies have been released recently.","jp":"最近、新しい映画がたくさん公開された。"}},{"english":"slope","reading":"さか","japanese":"坂","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"This slope is steep.","jp":"この坂は急だ。"}},{"english":"go down","reading":"さがる","japanese":"下がる","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"My fever has gone down.","jp":"熱が下がった。"}},{"english":"lower","reading":"さげる","japanese":"下げる","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"Please turn off the lights.","jp":"電気を消してください。"}},{"english":"lonely","reading":"さびしい","japanese":"寂しい","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"adjective","exampleSentence":{"en":"I feel lonely when I am by myself.","jp":"一人でいると寂しい。"}},{"english":"make noise","reading":"さわぐ","japanese":"騒ぐ","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"The children are making noise in the garden.","jp":"子供たちが庭で騒いでいる。"}},{"english":"touch","reading":"さわる","japanese":"触る","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"Please don''t touch this button.","jp":"このボタンに触らないでください。"}},{"english":"match","reading":"しあい","japanese":"試合","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","examp