y","reading":"しんぱいする","japanese":"心配する","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"Worry about one''s child.","jp":"子供のことが心配する。"}},{"english":"be shining","reading":"てる","japanese":"てる","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"The sun is shining brightly.","jp":"太陽が明るくてる。"}},{"english":"live","reading":"せいかつする","japanese":"生活する","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"He is living quietly in the countryside.","jp":"彼は田舎で静かに生活している。"}},{"english":"take care of","reading":"せわする","japanese":"世話する","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"I am taking care of my sick mother.","jp":"病気のお母さんの世話をしている。"}},{"english":"suffix for child / younger person","reading":"ちゃん","japanese":"ちゃん","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"phrase","exampleSentence":{"en":"Good morning, Hana-chan.","jp":"花ちゃん、おはよう。"}},{"english":"become","reading":"くなる","japanese":"くなる","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"phrase","exampleSentence":{"en":"To become cold.","jp":"寒くなる。"}},{"english":"enter school","reading":"にゅうがくする","japanese":"入学する","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"verb","exampleSentence":{"en":"I entered university in the spring.","jp":"春に大学に入学しました。"}},{"english":"causative suffix","reading":"せる","japanese":"せる","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"phrase","exampleSentence":{"en":"I made my brother do his homework.","jp":"弟に宿題をさせた。"}},{"english":"as expected","reading":"やっぱり","japanese":"やっぱり","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"adverb","exampleSentence":{"en":"As I thought, this method is the best.","jp":"やっぱり、この方法が一番いい。"}},{"english":"way of swimming","reading":"およぎかた","japanese":"およぎかた","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"Please teach me how to swim freestyle.","jp":"クロールの泳ぎ方を教えてください。"}},{"english":"building","reading":"ビル","japanese":"ビル","jlpt_level":"N4","partOfSpeech":"noun","exampleSentence":{"en":"What is that tall building?","jp":"あの高いビルは何ですか。"}},{"english":"oita","reading"